This package is a bundle. `dist/fcms-mcp.mjs` contains, compiled and inlined:

  @forinda-cms/sdk     the HTTP client for a forinda-cms server — Apache-2.0
  @forinda-cms/spec    the spec model, validation and diff     — Apache-2.0

Both remain available under Apache-2.0 on their own; the bundle as a whole is
AGPL-3.0-or-later.

Corresponding source for this bundle: https://github.com/forinda/fcms

Third-party dependencies (@modelcontextprotocol/sdk, zod) are declared in
package.json and installed from npm under their own licences. They are not
bundled here.
